{"id":"9b559d9a72ff847c","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-adelic-zeta.md","title":"Adelic Zeta Function","display":"df-adelic-zeta — Adelic Zeta Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-adelic-zeta","aliases":["58-df-adelic-zeta","Adelic Zeta Function"],"display":"df-adelic-zeta — Adelic Zeta Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-adelic]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-adelic-zeta"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-adelic-zeta</span><span>Adelic Zeta Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adelic-zeta — Adelic Zeta Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4095490ed42eb546\" href=\"?note=4095490ed42eb546\" title=\"58-df-adelic\">58-df-adelic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"82cd211c4765302c\" href=\"?note=82cd211c4765302c\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O,\\mathbb A_K,G_K,\\mu_K^\\times,\\chi_K,f,s,z\\in V\">\\(K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O,\\mathbb A_K,G_K,\\mu_K^\\times,\\chi_K,f,s,z\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O)\">\\(\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O)\\)</span> (set-coded adele ring, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4095490ed42eb546\" href=\"?note=4095490ed42eb546\" title=\"58-df-adelic\">58-df-adelic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_K=\\langle\\mathbb A_K^\\times,m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\rangle\">\\(G_K=\\langle\\mathbb A_K^\\times,m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S(\\mu_K^\\times,G_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S(\\mu_K^\\times,G_K)\\)</span> (idele-group data and a left Haar measure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"82cd211c4765302c\" href=\"?note=82cd211c4765302c\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb C\">\\(f\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb C\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_K\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\chi_K\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,z\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(s,z\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdelicZeta}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdelicZeta}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic\\text{-}zeta}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{AdelicZeta}_S(z,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O,\\mathbb A_K,G_K,\\mu_K^\\times,\\chi_K,f,s)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O)\\land\\exists m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\;\\Bigl(G_K=\\langle\\mathbb A_K^\\times,m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S(\\mu_K^\\times,G_K)\\land f\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb C\\land\\chi_K\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb A_K^\\times\\;\\bigl(\\chi_K(m_K(a,b))=\\chi_K(a)\\chi_K(b)\\bigr)\\land s,z\\in\\mathbb C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\int_{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\left|f(a)\\chi_K(a)^s\\right|\\,d\\mu_K^\\times(a)&lt;\\infty\\land z=\\int_{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}f(a)\\chi_K(a)^s\\,d\\mu_K^\\times(a)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic\\text{-}zeta}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{AdelicZeta}_S(z,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O,\\mathbb A_K,G_K,\\mu_K^\\times,\\chi_K,f,s)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O)\\land\\exists m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\;\\Bigl(G_K=\\langle\\mathbb A_K^\\times,m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S(\\mu_K^\\times,G_K)\\land f\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb C\\land\\chi_K\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb A_K^\\times\\;\\bigl(\\chi_K(m_K(a,b))=\\chi_K(a)\\chi_K(b)\\bigr)\\land s,z\\in\\mathbb C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\int_{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\left|f(a)\\chi_K(a)^s\\right|\\,d\\mu_K^\\times(a)&lt;\\infty\\land z=\\int_{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}f(a)\\chi_K(a)^s\\,d\\mu_K^\\times(a)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This graph definition exposes the adele ring, idele-group structure, Haar measure, multiplicative modulus and absolute-integrability condition; none of those truth-relevant parameters is hidden in prose.</li>\n<li>Tate's Schwartz--Bruhat domain is a sufficient source of admissible <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>; the displayed graph deliberately accepts every absolutely integrable input instead of invoking an undefined Schwartz--Bruhat-space primitive.</li>\n<li>Functional equation: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi_K(s) = \\xi_K(1-s)\">\\(\\xi_K(s) = \\xi_K(1-s)\\)</span> via Fourier transform</li>\n<li>Class number formula: residue at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=1\">\\(s=1\\)</span> gives class number times regulator</li>\n<li>Global field: function field analogue via geometric Langlands</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tate, Fourier Analysis in Number Fields and Hecke's Zeta-Functions</li>\n<li>Weil, Basic Number Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-adelic","status":"resolved","id":"4095490ed42eb546","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-adelic]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"82cd211c4765302c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-adelic","status":"resolved","id":"4095490ed42eb546","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O)$ (set-coded adele ring, see [[58-df-adelic]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"82cd211c4765302c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G_K=\\langle\\mathbb A_K^\\times,m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\rangle$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S(\\mu_K^\\times,G_K)$ (idele-group data and a left Haar measure, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O,\\mathbb A_K,G_K,\\mu_K^\\times,\\chi_K,f,s,z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O)","display":false},{"tex":"G_K=\\langle\\mathbb A_K^\\times,m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S(\\mu_K^\\times,G_K)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_K\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"s,z\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdelicZeta}_S\\subseteq V^{11}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic\\text{-}zeta}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{AdelicZeta}_S(z,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O,\\mathbb A_K,G_K,\\mu_K^\\times,\\chi_K,f,s)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O)\\land\\exists m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\;\\Bigl(G_K=\\langle\\mathbb A_K^\\times,m_K,e_K,i_K,\\tau_K\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S(\\mu_K^\\times,G_K)\\land f\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb C\\land\\chi_K\\in{}^{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\mathbb R_{>0}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb A_K^\\times\\;\\bigl(\\chi_K(m_K(a,b))=\\chi_K(a)\\chi_K(b)\\bigr)\\land s,z\\in\\mathbb C\\\\\n&\\land\\int_{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}\\left|f(a)\\chi_K(a)^s\\right|\\,d\\mu_K^\\times(a)<\\infty\\land z=\\int_{\\mathbb A_K^\\times}f(a)\\chi_K(a)^s\\,d\\mu_K^\\times(a)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi_K(s) = \\xi_K(1-s)","display":false},{"tex":"s=1","display":false}],"bytes":2435,"backlinks":[{"id":"11e1272c45fe01cc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-adelic-zeta.md|58-df-adelic-zeta]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["4095490ed42eb546","82cd211c4765302c"]}